.TH KUMCLIP 1 "2026" "kumde 0.8.0" "KumDE Manual"
.SH NAME
kumclip \- clipboard persistence daemon for KumDE
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kumclip
.SH DESCRIPTION
kumclip runs in the background and takes ownership of the Wayland
selection whenever another client sets one, keeping the last copied
content available after the source application exits. This is the
same role tools like wl-clip-persist fill on other compositors.
.PP
Text:
.BR text/plain ,
.BR text/plain;charset=utf-8 ,
.BR UTF8_STRING ,
.BR STRING .
.PP
Images:
.BR image/png ,
.BR image/jpeg ,
up to 32MB.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kumde (1)
